      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PENSATIVA (3) wasn't too far away first-up in the Moree Cup then couldn't quicken in the final stages over 1400m at Scone last time. Has a fine record at the mile and she needs that trip now at the third run back. Clearly the one to beat in a race of few chances. Veteran MACLEAY (4) was poorly away and settled last in the Moree Cup before passing more than half the field in the run home. Drawn to get a cosy run if he gets a clean start today. Capable of testing this field. ANCIENT EGYPT (2) was unsuited last start over 1000m here but did a good job to be beaten only 2.5 lengths. Best form comes at today's journey so keep him in mind. LINE OF FIRE (5) is not going well but gets some weight relief and the blinkers go back on - can improve sharply. The rest offer little encouragement on recent form.",
